; ==========================================
; First Steps in Tagalog / Filipino (tl)
; MultiLang-ASM Kids
; ==========================================

lagay kahon 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
dagdag kahon 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
bawas kahon 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
pakita kahon         ; Show the final candy count!
